{"id":"traje","lemma":"traje","pos":"noun","rank":574,"glosses":["suit","dress (distinctive style for particular occasion)","gown, dress (e.g. bridal gown, evening gown)"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾaxe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"trajes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-traje.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él me hizo un traje.","en":"He made me a suit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/71013","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella le hizo un nuevo traje.","en":"She made a new suit for him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587374","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"new"},null]},{"text":"Tu traje es igual al mío.","en":"Your suit is the same as mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594877","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"in the same way"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"mine"}]},{"text":"Lo traje para ti.","en":"I brought it for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454235","words":[{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]},{"text":"¿Qué pasa con el traje?","en":"What's with the outfit?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804535","words":[null,null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what's up?"]]}]}